# Generator messages that no test prints (test/lib/messages; checked by
# tools/messages). One line per message: FILE<TAB>FORMAT<TAB>REASON, with
# FORMAT as written between the quotes in FILE. Adding the test that
# prints a message means deleting its line here; tools/messages fails on
# an entry whose message a test prints or that FILE does not have.
src/check.zig	unreachable rule '{s}'	untested: the check-mode lint warning; needs a test
